    "detailed_description": "SPIN, WIN, SPIN, WIN, SPIN, PAY, REPEAT<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVery simple roguelike with a non-standard progression system.  Unlock additional cards and items with tokens unlocked as you play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMysterious 'Casino'-like setting.  Will you survive long enough to win it big?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n75 mostly unique cards. There's a lot of cats, but they are cute.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n45 mostly unique items.  Why isn't there 50? These were difficult to come up with tbh.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is my first real attempt at making a game, so please let me know any ways to improve this game.  I am already working on some future content!",
    "about_the_game": "SPIN, WIN, SPIN, WIN, SPIN, PAY, REPEAT<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVery simple roguelike with a non-standard progression system.  Unlock additional cards and items with tokens unlocked as you play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMysterious 'Casino'-like setting.  Will you survive long enough to win it big?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n75 mostly unique cards. There's a lot of cats, but they are cute.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n45 mostly unique items.  Why isn't there 50? These were difficult to come up with tbh.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is my first real attempt at making a game, so please let me know any ways to improve this game.  I am already working on some future content!",
